{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19810","headline":"折杨柳 一 · 孟郊","name":"折杨柳 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨柳多短枝，短枝多别离。\n赠远屡攀折，柔条安得垂。\n青春有定节，离别无定时。\n但恐人别促，不怨来迟迟。\n莫言短枝条，中有长相思。\n朱颜与绿杨，并在别离期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}